            <ArticleTitle>A life-threatening complication of undiagnosed congenital idiopathic megacolon.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr.04.2010.2888</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr0420102888</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of undiagnosed congenital idiopathic megacolon in a 16-year-old boy who presented with toxic megacolon and cardiovascular instability with a background of longstanding constipation is presented. He underwent life-saving subtotal colectomy from which he made a full recovery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
